WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:06.606
Belarus has confirmed

00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:07.974
Russia has begun transferring

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:09.876
tactical nuclear weapons to Belarus.

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:10.944
And territory.

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:12.312
Ukraine's northern neighbor

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:13.580
has been Moscow's closest

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:16.016
ally since this war began last February,

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:17.717
when Russia invaded.

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:19.419
Russia has repeatedly used Belarus

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:21.121
as a staging ground for incursions

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:21.988
into Ukraine,

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:22.856
Russia and Belarus,

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:24.024
and defense ministers

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:25.558
signed the agreement on Thursday

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:27.560
to deploy the tactical nuclear weapons.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:28.294
Opposition leaders

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:29.729
in Belarus denounced the move,

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:31.197
and the US government says

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:32.332
nature is not changing

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:33.700
its defensive posture.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:34.367
Experts say

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.269
the move isn't only dangerous.

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:38.304
It's against the law.

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:39.873
It's illegal.

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:40.874
This violates

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:42.409
several international agreements,

00:00:42.409 --> 00:00:44.377
including BELT that Belarus has signed,

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:45.211
including the Nuclear

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:46.479
Nonproliferation Treaty,

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:46.980
where it says

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.481
it will be a non-nuclear

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:50.483
state will not possess nuclear weapons.

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:51.751
It violates the

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:54.087
Budapest Memorandum of 1994

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:56.389
when Belarus gave up the Soviet

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:57.090
nuclear weapons

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:58.425
that have been stationed there.

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:01.428
It it violates the Belarus constitution.

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:02.262
It violates

00:01:02.262 --> 00:01:03.730
Putin's own statements

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:06.132
of just two months ago when with China

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:08.902
he declared that no nation should station

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:09.936
nuclear weapons

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:11.438
outside their own territory.

00:01:11.438 --> 00:01:12.839
Here he is doing that.

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:15.141
Meanwhile, we are getting

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:16.976
reports of a new wave of Russian strikes

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:18.378
on Ukraine that pummeled the country.

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:19.145
How is Overnight,

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:20.380
Sam has been looking about

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:21.748
what can you tell us, Alma?

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:24.684
So a massive wave of attack,

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:25.685
drones and missiles

00:01:25.685 --> 00:01:27.987
coming overnight that hit Kharkiv.

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:30.356
They hit Dnipro. They hit Kiev.

00:01:30.356 --> 00:01:32.992
The Ukrainian air force saying 17 cruise

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:35.695
missiles in 31 attack drones.

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:36.896
One official engineer wrote,

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:37.363
describing it

00:01:37.363 --> 00:01:38.765
as an extremely difficult night,

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:40.767
saying that this lasted for hours.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.135
It was extremely loud.

00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:43.736
There was damage to buildings.

00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:45.338
We don't know of any casualties

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:46.873
so far or injuries.

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:48.141
But put this in the context

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:48.908
of course,

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:50.810
of this expected counteroffensive.

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:51.911
And you begin to understand

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:53.079
everything that Ukraine

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:53.880
is juggling

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:54.881
from attacks

00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:56.249
to civilian areas

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:57.984
all the way across the country.

00:01:57.984 --> 00:01:58.852
To of course,

00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:00.753
there's very difficult battles

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:01.855
along those front lines.

00:02:01.855 --> 00:02:03.623
And of course, recently, Bermuda

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:05.024
mostly lost to Russia.

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:05.658
Ukraine insists

00:02:05.658 --> 00:02:07.694
that it does have pockets of resistance

00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:09.229
but again, on the back foot

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:10.964
in Bermuda, on those front lines

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:13.099
and dealing with a massive barrage

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:14.701
of missiles and drone attacks,

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:16.469
Washington has stated publicly

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:18.371
since last summer that they believe

00:02:18.371 --> 00:02:20.573
Iran is supplying Russia with drones

00:02:20.573 --> 00:02:22.342
to aid their invasion of Ukraine.

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:23.810
You've been investigating this

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:26.012
because it is a claim denied

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:27.814
vehemently by Iran Yes.

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:29.082
So those drone attacks

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:29.883
that happened last night

00:02:29.883 --> 00:02:31.017
and many of the drone attacks

00:02:31.017 --> 00:02:32.252
we've seen over the last weeks

00:02:32.252 --> 00:02:32.785
and months,

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:34.754
those drones are Iranian made,

00:02:34.754 --> 00:02:36.289
according to Ukrainian officials.

00:02:36.289 --> 00:02:38.391
We as journalists have seen our teams on

00:02:38.391 --> 00:02:40.059
the ground have seen the remnants

00:02:40.059 --> 00:02:41.594
of these Iranian made drones.

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:42.495
The question is,

00:02:42.495 --> 00:02:44.130
how are they getting there? Take a look

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.102
These calm waters are home

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:49.903
to a secret

00:02:49.903 --> 00:02:52.071
Russia doesn't want you to know.

00:02:52.906 --> 00:02:53.873
Experts say

00:02:53.873 --> 00:02:57.210
Iran is quietly sending weapons on ships

00:02:57.210 --> 00:03:00.113
like this one across the Caspian Sea

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:01.614
to replenish arms

00:03:01.614 --> 00:03:04.284
for Moscow's war on Ukraine.

00:03:04.284 --> 00:03:05.285
Concealing movement

00:03:05.285 --> 00:03:06.619
at sea is considered

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:08.821
nefarious and potentially a violation

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:10.957
of international law.

00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:12.458
But in the Caspian Sea,

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:14.160
there's a growing number of gaps

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:17.297
in vessels tracking data known as this,

00:03:17.664 --> 00:03:20.433
with a more than 50% increase in ships

00:03:20.433 --> 00:03:21.701
hiding their movement

00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:24.704
between August and September of 2022,

00:03:24.904 --> 00:03:27.040
according to maritime trafficking data.

00:03:27.473 --> 00:03:28.408
Most of the vessels

00:03:28.408 --> 00:03:30.376
going dark are Iranian

00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:33.012
or Russian flag tankers to Russia, where

00:03:33.413 --> 00:03:34.981
the timing is suspicious

00:03:34.981 --> 00:03:36.382
to this practice.

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:37.750
Picking up last summer,

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:38.751
just as White House

00:03:38.751 --> 00:03:39.786
officials revealed

00:03:39.786 --> 00:03:40.920
that Russia had purchased

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:43.389
hundreds of drones from Iran.

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:45.959
So why would these ships want to hide

00:03:45.959 --> 00:03:47.393
their movements?

00:03:47.393 --> 00:03:49.095
Maritime security analyst

00:03:49.095 --> 00:03:50.463
Martin Kelly tells us

00:03:50.463 --> 00:03:50.964
it is

00:03:50.964 --> 00:03:52.365
likely because

00:03:52.365 --> 00:03:54.734
of what these vessels are carrying.

00:03:55.001 --> 00:03:56.703
There's a correlation between Russia

00:03:56.703 --> 00:03:58.471
requesting drones from Iran,

00:03:58.471 --> 00:03:59.138
doc port

00:03:59.138 --> 00:04:00.540
calls in the Caspian Sea

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:03.009
and an increase in activity.

00:04:03.009 --> 00:04:04.677
And that to me was a key indicator

00:04:04.677 --> 00:04:06.879
of these three aspects combined

00:04:07.447 --> 00:04:09.382
that that something was going

00:04:09.382 --> 00:04:12.118
on, probably the export of Iranian drones

00:04:12.151 --> 00:04:13.052
from Russia.

00:04:13.052 --> 00:04:15.054
This heat map from Lloyd's List

00:04:15.054 --> 00:04:17.857
shows where most of those gaps in air

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:19.125
are concentrated,

00:04:19.125 --> 00:04:20.760
mostly near Iran's

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:23.029
Mirabaud Port and Russia's

00:04:23.029 --> 00:04:24.597
Astrakhan port,

00:04:24.597 --> 00:04:25.331
where ships

00:04:25.331 --> 00:04:26.566
appear to be turning

00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:28.401
off their data on approach

00:04:28.401 --> 00:04:29.435
and going dark

00:04:29.435 --> 00:04:31.504
for extended periods of time.

00:04:31.871 --> 00:04:33.373
Now, using data like this

00:04:33.373 --> 00:04:34.140
and expert

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:36.809
analysis, CNN was able to identify

00:04:36.943 --> 00:04:37.944
eight vessels

00:04:37.944 --> 00:04:40.113
that exhibited suspicious behavior

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.948
in the Caspian Sea.

00:04:41.948 --> 00:04:44.550
This is one such vessel.

00:04:44.817 --> 00:04:46.819
It's a Russian flag tanker

00:04:46.819 --> 00:04:48.755
that was seen in early January,

00:04:48.755 --> 00:04:51.224
leaving Iran's a mirror bad port,

00:04:51.391 --> 00:04:53.993
making its way across the Caspian Sea

00:04:54.227 --> 00:04:56.596
to Russia's Astrakhan port.

00:04:56.596 --> 00:04:59.365
Now, we cannot independently verify

00:04:59.399 --> 00:05:01.434
what this tanker was carrying,

00:05:01.701 --> 00:05:03.002
but experts tell us

00:05:03.002 --> 00:05:05.305
the shipment was likely linked

00:05:05.505 --> 00:05:06.439
to the arms trade.

00:05:07.674 --> 00:05:08.041
And there

00:05:08.041 --> 00:05:09.876
are signs that Tehran could be

00:05:09.876 --> 00:05:12.445
ere mailing arms to the U.S.

00:05:12.445 --> 00:05:12.979
and Ukraine,

00:05:12.979 --> 00:05:13.746
both accused

00:05:13.746 --> 00:05:16.115
Tehran of sending supplies to Russia

00:05:16.115 --> 00:05:17.617
by plane.

00:05:17.784 --> 00:05:19.919
CNN analyzed the tracking data

00:05:19.919 --> 00:05:21.988
of four Iranian cargo planes

00:05:21.988 --> 00:05:23.022
flagged by the U.S.

00:05:23.022 --> 00:05:24.090
Commerce Department

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:26.426
for potentially carrying drone shipments.

00:05:27.894 --> 00:05:29.629
Collectively, the aircraft

00:05:29.629 --> 00:05:32.498
made at least 85 trips to Moscow airports

00:05:32.732 --> 00:05:36.736
between May 2022 and March 2023

00:05:38.938 --> 00:05:40.206
Iran has admitted

00:05:40.206 --> 00:05:40.773
that it saw

00:05:40.773 --> 00:05:43.576
a small number of drones to Russia,

00:05:43.576 --> 00:05:44.777
but it says the SEAL

00:05:44.777 --> 00:05:45.545
was a few months

00:05:45.545 --> 00:05:47.880
prior to the war in Ukraine.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.148
CNN has reached out

00:05:49.148 --> 00:05:51.150
to Iran and Russia for comment,

00:05:51.451 --> 00:05:55.221
but has yet to receive a response.

00:05:55.221 --> 00:05:56.522
But given the much larger

00:05:56.522 --> 00:05:58.658
volume, cargo ships can carry,

00:05:58.658 --> 00:06:00.159
the Caspian Sea corridor

00:06:00.159 --> 00:06:02.662
is likely the primary conduit.

00:06:02.829 --> 00:06:05.732
And experts say it is the new frontier

00:06:05.898 --> 00:06:07.900
for weapons trade between Moscow

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:08.968
and Tehran.

00:06:08.968 --> 00:06:11.704
Tucked away from Western interference,

00:06:12.472 --> 00:06:13.740
it provides an easy

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:15.641
avenue for sanctions evasion.

00:06:15.641 --> 00:06:16.509
Expert Anisa

00:06:16.509 --> 00:06:17.710
Tabrizi says

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:19.445
I think the perception in Moscow

00:06:19.445 --> 00:06:21.481
is that Iran can teach a lot

00:06:21.614 --> 00:06:23.249
to Moscow about how to go

00:06:23.249 --> 00:06:24.784
and how to

00:06:24.884 --> 00:06:27.120
still have a significant economy.

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:29.756
Even when sanctions are imposed.

00:06:29.756 --> 00:06:31.090
And there is very little.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:31.591
The U.S.

00:06:31.591 --> 00:06:34.427
and its allies can do to stop it.

00:06:34.427 --> 00:06:36.529
And more could be on the way.

00:06:36.529 --> 00:06:37.830
Intelligence officials

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:39.031
warned in November,

00:06:39.031 --> 00:06:40.800
Iran plans to send ballistic

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:42.034
missiles, ammunition

00:06:42.034 --> 00:06:44.670
and more sophisticated drones to Moscow,

00:06:45.338 --> 00:06:47.940
a bustling corridor potentially providing

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:49.842
a much needed arsenal.

00:06:49.842 --> 00:06:52.078
Critical to Russia's land grab

00:06:52.078 --> 00:06:52.912
in Ukraine.

00:06:55.181 --> 00:06:55.481
Now, you

00:06:55.481 --> 00:06:56.783
can't underestimate

00:06:56.783 --> 00:06:58.584
the impact of these Iranian

00:06:58.584 --> 00:07:00.186
made drones on the conflict.

00:07:00.186 --> 00:07:01.020
They are small.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.822
They are difficult to be detected

00:07:02.822 --> 00:07:04.123
by the air

00:07:04.123 --> 00:07:06.225
defense technology that Ukraine has.

00:07:06.259 --> 00:07:08.761
They can cause a great deal of damage.

00:07:08.761 --> 00:07:09.862
They frustrate

00:07:09.862 --> 00:07:10.763
Ukraine at a time

00:07:10.763 --> 00:07:11.264
when it's trying

00:07:11.264 --> 00:07:12.932
to fight on those front lines.

00:07:12.932 --> 00:07:13.966
And as you heard there,

00:07:13.966 --> 00:07:15.101
the concern is, is

00:07:15.101 --> 00:07:16.803
that Iran could provide more

00:07:16.803 --> 00:07:18.271
than just drones.

00:07:18.271 --> 00:07:19.172
This relationship

00:07:19.172 --> 00:07:21.707
between Moscow and Tehran is deepening.

00:07:21.707 --> 00:07:23.709
The cooperation is becoming

00:07:23.709 --> 00:07:25.311
more and more important

00:07:25.311 --> 00:07:27.680
as Russia turns to Iran for help

00:07:27.947 --> 00:07:29.649
to replenish its arsenal.

00:07:29.649 --> 00:07:31.584
Of course, on those front lines.

00:07:31.584 --> 00:07:33.252
Iran sees an opportunity here

00:07:33.252 --> 00:07:34.253
to rebalance

00:07:34.253 --> 00:07:35.421
if you will, its relationship

00:07:35.421 --> 00:07:37.657
with Moscow, experts tell us.

00:07:38.424 --> 00:07:40.560
And the key thing here to remember

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:41.694
is the Caspian Sea.

00:07:41.694 --> 00:07:43.196
Just take a look at that map.

00:07:43.196 --> 00:07:44.797
The US doesn't have a footprint there.

00:07:44.797 --> 00:07:46.399
Neato. Doesn't have a footprint there.

00:07:46.399 --> 00:07:48.234
It is extremely difficult

00:07:48.234 --> 00:07:48.868
for Ukraine's

00:07:48.868 --> 00:07:50.870
western allies to stop this, if at all.

00:07:51.504 --> 00:07:52.104
Okay, Salma,

00:07:52.104 --> 00:07:52.705
thank you very much

00:07:52.705 --> 00:07:53.539
indeed for bringing us that

00:07:53.539 --> 00:07:54.207
great reporting.

